                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                        "entry_id": "cf2e77c4-2821-3836-8431-81d76b99eb3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Beautiful, splendid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd9c47ba-9602-4e69-8e11-34519074a1e1",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "Oh ! you splendiferous creatur’! you anngeliferous anngel! here am I, Ralph Stackpole the Screamer[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52d5546e-6c37-47be-8986-5ca489afa901",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "And I'd like to have a large house and a splendiferous garden, and then you could all come and live with me, and we would play in the garden, and Dorry should have turkey five times a day if he liked."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20f18332-5b06-4d25-bde6-38c715f4fa2e",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "\"[…]I want to write something most splendiferous to-day, and I am sure to find it in your face. I have ceased to be an original writer; all the purple patches are cribbed from you.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad0e5d8a-1eb1-4b77-8527-a8643f20e73c",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "You move a motion? Steve boy, you’re going it some. More bluggy drunkables? Will immensely splendiferous stander permit one stooder of most extreme poverty and one largesize grandacious thirst to terminate one expensive inaugurated libation?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7142762f-1a5c-4122-95a8-e156910358be",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "but somebody who'd given my Uncle Sol a Victor\nVictrola and records while he lived presented to\nhim upon the auspicious occasion of his decease a\nscrumptious not to mention splendiferous funeral with\ntall boys in black gloves and flowers and everything and"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37c1c16a-a404-4747-80d5-0c31ed135121",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "Hey boss, did you ever see a more splendiferous crash?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "579cf260-ce16-457b-b700-ed5ee00c617c",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "[…]he was trying to convince the Spaniards on the Viceroy's brig that they really ought to be interested in certain splendiferous goods that he, Mr. Foot, the owner and captain of this galleot, had of late brought out of the Orient—particularly, carpets."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "990fac5d-f09d-4f38-8f5e-8f47294e877b",
                                "sense_id": "39b6fa71-a03b-3c8c-b551-3656209a6191",
                                "text": "Okja begins with a splendiferous introduction to its title character. Who is Okja?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
